This directory contains the source of mksprite, a utility to create sprite for glob2 from a bunch of images. This utility requires Magick++, freely available at:
http://studio.imagemagick.org/Magick++/

Steph, 2 Jan 2005

world_atlas.py bakes real geography (Natural Earth coasts, lakes, rivers, deserts and ranges; the
Köppen-Geiger climate classes) into src/map/generator/shared/WorldAtlasData.cpp for the Continents
map generator. See docs/map-generators/WORLD_ATLAS.md.
